<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:47:28 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Jăng thưq yưk</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Jăng</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Jn</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Jăng</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Varơuq 'miêh e xing kapa tep, laa varơuq 'wot heq tameng, laa varơuq 'wot heq hloq bơơn mot 'wot, laa varơuq 'wot heq 'yo atrêêk, ji ti 'wot heq vêq muut, tajinq truh Apok ku varơuq riirh — <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />dik, varơuq riirh heq jah kahnoq vlôh ji 'wot heq 'yo hloq, 'wot đong dơơp xanưk ji padoh pahêêr ka oh ay varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, laa varơuq 'miêh măn dii Vaq ji heq jah kahnoq vlôh ka 'wot — <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />varơuq 'wot heq hloq ji heq tameng, yôôych 'wot đnooy vlôh ka oh ay, xôq oh ay kung e varơuq athêêk tajauq dii 'wot. Dik, varơuq athêêk tajauq ku haay laa dii Vaq ji dii Koot Kadraq, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />'Wot valơk kaluh apok neq xôq varơuq hlah hlaak ku haay jah xaleep. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: </char><char style="fqa">ji 'wot valơk kaluh apok neq ka oh ay xôq xuum hlah hlaak ku oh ay jah xaleep</char>.</note><verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Neq laa apok kơy plêêk đơu 'wot heq tameng xing Kadraq ji đong padoh pahêêr ka oh ay, đaneq: Kơy Plêêk laa varơuq tađnah ji đom Kadraq leh e paq kê varơuq kamơng jaluk leq. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Atoh haay đnooy đaneq haay e varơuq athêêk tajauq dii Kadraq, đơu kung tawaak hooy đom varơuq kamơng jaluk, yôôych haay đong đnooy pa ôôh ji leh dơơp tyauq varơuq dik. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Bơh atoh haay tawaak hooy đom varơuq tađnah đaji kadih Kadraq măn đom varơuq tađnah, yôôych haay e varơuq athêêk tajauq dii mamuuyq, ji vahaap Lôôk Jê-xu, Koot Kadraq, paxa rêh haay klơlh tôôy kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="1JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Atoh haay đnooy đaneq haay be e kadrôôp, yôôych haay đong kadih aluut pa ôôh haay ji varơuq dik leh măn đom haay. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Atoh haay xưng vlôh kadrôôp maroh haay, yôôych Kadraq laa jư apok ji hyioh jăk, xôq ka'lăk kadrôôp ka haay ji paxa rêh haay klơlh tôôy varơuq leh hyioh jăk. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Atoh haay đnooy đaneq haay koq hmưq lôp kadrôôp, yôôych haay 'yo Kadraq laa dro đnooy pa ôôh, ji Apok Kadraq leh măn đom haay.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Êêp koot ku gô, gô valơk kaluh varơuq neq ka êêp koot xôq êêp koot leh lôp kadrôôp. Ji atoh e kơyq lôp kadrôôp, yôôych haay e muuyq Kơy apôôy thay dii Vaq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Kơy hyioh jăk. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Kadraq laa kuah lêh bla kadrôôp vii kadrôôp maroh ku haay, bơh leh vơ ka kadrôôp ku haay, đơu măn ka kadrôôp ku dêq hloay dêh araak đnoyq. <verse eid="1JN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Atoh haay tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq, yôôych gamưh đnư haay xet đaneq haay heq nhonq xet Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Kơyq đnooy đaneq: “Gô xet Kadraq” đơu leh tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq, nưq laa dro đnooy pa ôôh, ji varơuq dik be măn đom adro nưq. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Bơh atoh kơyq tameng jư apok Kadraq, yôôych xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk kajưk dik jah xaleep đom adro nưq. Haay xet đaneq haay măn đom Kadraq bơyh varơuq neq: <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />adro leq đnooy ni đong măn đom Kadraq, yôôych kadih adro nưq kung pheq riirh dang đaji Kadraq heq riirh.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Oh ay xung xiaq, gô leh valơk ka oh ay muuyq ganeen đơơu, bơh laa ganeen duut đơu oh ay heq e xing tuôôy kapa tep. Ganeen duut nưq laa apok đơu oh ay heq tameng. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Panưh kadrơy, gô valơk ka oh ay muuyq ganeen đơơu, đơu ganeen nưq laa dong dik đom Kadraq ji đom oh ay, vii varơuq kamơng jaluk jah pachuh hlơơp, ji varơuq tađnah dik đong ahnhe tađnah yôôch. <verse eid="1JN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Kơyq đnooy ni măn đom varơuq tađnah đơu laay 'yarơ oh ay ni yôôych juneq đong măn đom varơuq kamơng jaluk. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Kơyq xiaq oh ay ni yôôych kưq măn đom varơuq tađnah, ji kơq dơơp xatôôlh gưlh leh e đom adro nưq. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Bơh kơyq 'yarơ oh ay ni laa măn đom kamơng ji tawaak hooy đom kamơng jaluk, adro nưq kung leh xet ni đong hooy maleq, vii kamơng jaluk heq dơơp apul mot ni.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Khơl koot lơơy, gô valơk ka khơl koot vii kadrôôp khơl koot heq jah ka'lăk gamưh yal Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Wơơy khơl dơơp vaq, gô valơk ka êêp kơy vii êêp kơy heq xet Kơy e xing kapa tep. Khơl tadăp blaay lơơy, gô valơk ka êêp 'wơyq vii êêp 'wơyq heq jay iaq dro xơk. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp hnu iaq athêêp: </char><char style="fqa">Khơl koot de hrưưch, gô valơk ka khơl koot vii khơl koot heq xet Vaq </char> măn đnen, bơh kaluh rahlăp hnu đangq gamưh tuôq dik yôôych xôq iq neq đom apok 14.</note> <verse eid="1JN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Khơl oh de lơơy, gô heq valơk ka êêp koot vii êêp koot heq xet Vaq. Wơơy khơl dơơp vaq, gô heq valơk ka êêp kơy, vii êêp kơy heq xet Kơy e xing kapa tep. Khơl tadăp blaay lơơy, gô heq valơk ka êêp 'wơyq vii êêp 'wơyq kalh paraat, apok Kơy Plêêk đong măn đom êêp 'wơyq, ji êêp 'wơyq heq jay ik dro xơk. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp hnu xôq: </char><char style="fqa">Khơl koot de hrưưch, gô heq valơk ka êêp koot vii êêp koot heq xet Vaq </char> đom apok 13.</note> <verse eid="1JN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Te xiaq dêh araak kung đaji kaluh kajoq đom dêh araak. Atoh kơyq xiaq dêh araak yôôych xung xiaq ku Vaq be măn đom adro nưq. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Vii tôôy thưq đom dêh araak — đaji varơuq hmưch trôôch ku xăk xamơk, varơuq hmưch trôôch ku mot, ji katik katơơk galơh ku đơơy — be aalq laa xing Vaq bơh laa xing dêh araak. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Ji dêh araak biq tapol hlơơp kung dii xuum trôôch ku ni, bơh kơyq dơơp tyauq iq trôôch Kơy Plêêk yôôych kưq măn truh đơơy đơơy.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Khơl oh de lơơy, juneq laa wat lôôch dik, ji đaji êêp koot e tameng đaneq dro tachơơl hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đong truh, ji juneq 'ngưng dro tachơơl hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq truh, lunưq haay xet đaneq juneq laa wat lôôch dik. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Bing oot hooy vlôh xing haay, bơh oot leh thuôk xuq haay. Vii atoh thuôk xuq haay, yôôych oot dik heq laa kưq măn đnoyq dii haay, bơh leh aalq anưq, xôq oot biq kahnoq vlôh đaneq oot leh thuôk xuq haay kajoq dêq. <verse eid="1JN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Măn êêp koot yôôych e varơuq para jơu xing Kơy Vah, ji êêp koot raay heq nhonq xet. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp juneq kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">ji êêp koot e kaluh varơuq hlolh xet</char>. Muuyq xôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: <char style="fqa">ji êêp koot xet dêq kaluh varơuq</char>.</note> <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Gô heq valơk ka êêp koot be aalq vii êêp koot leh xet varơuq dik, bơh vii êêp koot heq xet varơuq dik ji vii be e varơuq pa ôôh lar leq laa vlôh xing varơuq dik. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Kơyq laa dro đnooy pa ôôh atoh leh aalq dro chôôyq ka'lăk, đnooy đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu be aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh? Dro nưq jơq laa dro tachơơl hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, 'ngưq laa dro chôôyq ka'lăk Vaq ji Koot. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Adro leq chôôyq ka'lăk Koot yôôych leh e Vaq. Măn kơyq xưng nhonq Koot yôôych kung e Vaq đnoyq. <verse eid="1JN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Măn phon êêp koot, dayh xôq varơuq êêp koot heq tameng xing tuôôy kapa tep măn đnoyq đom xăk. Atoh varơuq êêp koot heq tameng xing tuôôy kapa tep kưq măn đom êêp koot, yôôych êêp koot kung hnoq kưq măn đom Koot ji đom Vaq. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Ji neq laa apok tavek đơu Kadraq heq xanoh tavek dii haay — 'ngưq laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="1JN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Gô heq valơk kaluh apok neq ka êêp koot truh khơl dro jarooy aluut êêp koot hooy hyaak hyul. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Măn phon êêp koot, varơuq para jơu đơu êêp koot heq nhonq xing aduq Kadraq đong măn đom êêp koot, ji êêp koot be e varơuq duh xôq muuyq kơyq nưq pato dayq êêp. Wih hlê, đaji varơuq para jơu ku Kadraq đong pato êêp koot truh tôôy varơuq, ji nưq laa dong dik leh aalq laa pa ôôh lar, kung đaji heq pato êêp koot kưq măn đom Kadraq.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Juneq, khơl koot lơơy, dayh kưq măn đom Kadraq, xôq atoh tuôôy Kadraq rama vlôh, haay e xuum kôk kalh ji leh biq kamưưl kangưưr Kadraq muut tuôôy Kadraq truh. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Atoh êêp koot xet đaneq Kadraq laa hyioh jăk, yôôych êêp koot kung xet đaneq tôôy adro dơơp varơuq hyioh jăk raay jah pahleh vlôh xing Kadraq.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Dayh 'yo Vaq heq kahniq xung xiaq xet dong leq ka haay, pheq đnooy haay jah taayh laa koot Kơy Plêêk, ji haay dik đanưq. Vii kakơq neq, dêh araak be xet haay, vii dêh araak leh xet Kadraq. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp hnu iaq dơh ka'lăk kum apok: </char><char style="fqa">ji haay dik đanưq</char>.</note> <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Oh ay xung xiaq, juneq haay laa koot xau Kơy Plêêk, măn haay hnoq laa đaji luleq yôôych măn koq jah kahnoq vlôh. Haay xet đaneq tuôôy Kadraq rama vlôh, haay hnoq jêêk vlôh dang đaji Kadraq, vii haay hnoq hloq Kadraq đaji Kadraq 'miêh e. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Ji paq kê kơyq e takôô gamưh neq aduq Kadraq, yôôych dơơp kadih ka ni pa xarêh, đaji Kadraq laa pa xarêh. <verse eid="1JN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Paq kê kơyq lôp kadrôôp kung laa dơơp varơuq lưp ganuun. Dik anưq, kadrôôp maroh laa varơuq lưp ganuun. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Oh ay xet đaneq kadih Kadraq heq rama vlôh xôq taway kadrôôp maroh hooy, ji kadrôôp maroh leh măn đom Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Atoh kơyq kưq măn đom Kadraq yôôych leh raxôôt lôp kadrôôp. Atoh kơyq kưq lôp kadrôôp yôôych koq hmưq hloq Kadraq, kung koq hmưq xet Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Khơl koot lơơy, te xôq kơyq jarooy aluut êêp koot hooy hyaak hyul. Kơyq dơơp varơuq hyioh jăk laa hyioh jăk, đaji kadih Kadraq laa hyioh jăk. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Kơyq kưq lôp kadrôôp laa thuôk xuq kamuuych, vii kamuuych heq lôp kadrôôp xing kapa tep. Vii kơq nưq, Koot Kơy Plêêk heq rama vlôh xôq pahyaak ka'lăk varơuq dơơp ku kamuuych. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Atoh kơyq heq jah pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk yôôych leh kưq lôp kadrôôp vii adrek riirh ku Kadraq đong măn đom adro nưq. Ji adro nưq leh hnoq ik raxôôt lôp kadrôôp vii heq jah pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Gamưh varơuq neq koot xau Kơy Plêêk ji koot xau kamuuych e varơuq kahra vlôh ra raang: Atoh kơyq leh dơơp varơuq hyioh jăk laa leh thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk, ji dro leh xung xiaq oh ay ni kung đanưq. <verse eid="1JN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Vii neq laa apok kơy plêêk đơu êêp koot heq tameng xing tuôôy kapa tep, nưq laa haay pheq xung xiaq mamuuyq, <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />te đaji Ka-in, dro thuôk xuq kamuuych ji heq păk kaxêêt ma oh ni. Kakơq leq đơu kơy heq păk kaxêêt ma oh kơy? Nưq laa vii kaluh varơuq dơơp ku kơy laa xơk, bơh kaluh varơuq ku ma oh kơy yôôych hyioh jăk.<verse eid="1JN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Wơơy oh ay, teliq tưng hưng atoh dêh araak 'yarơ geet oh ay. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Haay xet đaneq haay heq dalơh vlôh klơlh varơuq kaxêêt đơu muut đom varơuq riirh, bơyh vii haay xung xiaq oh ay haay. Kơyq leh xiaq yôôych đong măn đom varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Atoh kơyq 'yarơ oh ay ni laa dro păk kaxêêt manih, ji oh ay xet đaneq tôôy dro păk kaxêêt manih raay be e varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy măn đom ni. <verse eid="1JN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Gamưh varơuq neq haay nhonq xet xuum xung xiaq: nưq laa kadih Kadraq heq chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh ku Kadraq vii haay. Haay kung duh chiuq kaxêêt xăk riirh haay vii khơl oh ay. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Bơh kơyq e garuh anôôp dêh araak ji hloq muuyq adro oh ay ni đong e varơuq duh đơu laay jư riit xuum ni dii adro oh ay nưq, yôôych dơơp aleq xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk đong măn đom adro nưq ik? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Khơl koot lơơy, teliq xiaq bơơn apok long ka huuy vel xarooy, bơh bơơn varơuq dơơp ji varơuq dik. <verse eid="1JN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Gamưh đnư, haay hnoq xet đaneq haay thuôk xuq varơuq dik ji haay hnoq dơơp kajưk xuum haay kangưưr Kadraq, <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />vii atoh xuum haay atok xadrah kadih haay, yôôych yơu kajoq Kơy Plêêk laa kôt iaq xuum haay ji Kadraq xet hlolh tôôy varơuq. <verse eid="1JN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Oh ay xung xiaq, atoh xuum haay leh atok xadrah, yôôych haay e varơuq kôk kalh wih xuq Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />ji paq kê varơuq kajoq haay apôôy vôôch yôôych haay nhonq jah xing Kadraq, vii haay tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq ji dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq Kadraq kaxay xuum kangưưr Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Ji neq laa ganeen ku Kadraq, nưq laa: haay pheq tuôq yal Koot Kadraq, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji xung xiaq mamuuyq dang đaji Kadraq heq xanoh pato ganeen ka haay. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Kơyq tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq yôôych kưq măn đom Kadraq, ji Kadraq đom adro nưq. Ji gamưh varơuq neq, haay xet đaneq Kadraq đong măn đom haay laa gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel đơu Kadraq heq kahniq ka haay.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Oh ay xung xiaq, te tuôq tôôy yaak, bơh pheq thư kaluh yaak xôq 'yo oot e jơq be laa xing Kơy Plêêk, vii 'ngưng kơy hlit pa ôôh heq hooy loch đom dêh araak. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Gamưh varơuq neq, oh ay nhonq xet Yaak ku Kơy Plêêk: yaak leq đơu xưng nhonq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu heq truh đom xăk xamơk, nưq laa xing Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />măn yaak leq đơu leh xưng nhonq Lôôk Jê-xu yôôych leh aalq xing Kơy Plêêk. Nưq laa yaak ku dro tachơơl hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đơu oh ay heq tameng đaneq đong truh, ji juneq măn đom dêh araak yôôch. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu đok </char><char style="fqa">ji yaak (garu xi) leq đơu leh nhonq xet đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu heq truh đom xăk xamơk laa leh aalq xing Kơy Plêêk. Nưq laa yaak (garu xi) ku dro tachơơl hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, đơu oh ay heq tameng laa đong truh, ji juneq đong măn đom dêh araak yôôch.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Khơl koot lơơy, êêp koot thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk, ji heq jay iaq oot, vii Kơy măn đom êêp koot kôt iaq dro đom dêh araak. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Oot thuôk xuq dêh araak. Vii kơq nưq, oot đnooy tyauq dêh araak, ji dêh araak tameng oot. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />'Wot thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk. Kơyq xet Kơy Plêêk yôôych tameng 'wot. Kơyq leh thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk yôôych leh tameng 'wot. Gamưh varơuq nưq, haay nhonq xet yaak ku varơuq dik ji yaak ku varơuq hyaak hyul.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Oh ay xung xiaq, haay duh pheq xung xiaq mamuuyq, vii xung xiaq laa xing Kơy Plêêk, ji atoh kơyq xiaq yôôych jah pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk ji nhonq xet Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Kơyq leh xiaq yôôych leh xet Kơy Plêêk, vii Kơy Plêêk laa xung xiaq. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk heq jah kahnoq vlôh katul haay đom varơuq neq, nưq laa Kơy Plêêk heq patăk Koot Muuyq ku Kadraq pôôt dêh araak xôq haay jah riirh gamưh Koot nưq. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Xung xiaq măn đom varơuq neq, nưq be aalq haay heq xiaq Kơy Plêêk, bơh nưq laa Kadraq heq xiaq haay, ji patăk Koot Kadraq dơơp kuah lêh bla kadrôôp vii kadrôôp maroh ku haay. <verse eid="1JN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Oh ay xung xiaq, atoh Kơy Plêêk heq xiaq haay đanưq, yôôych haay kung pheq xung xiaq mamuuyq. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Koq ekơyq hmưq 'yo hloq Kơy Plêêk. Atoh haay xiaq mamuuyq, yôôych Kơy Plêêk kưq măn đom haay ji xung xiaq Kadraq jah xaleep măn đom haay. <verse eid="1JN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Gamưh varơuq neq haay xet đaneq haay đong măn đom Kadraq ji Kadraq đom haay, nưq laa Kadraq heq kahniq ka haay Kơy Phool Hiel Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />'Wot kung heq hloq ji đong dơơp xanưk đaneq Vaq heq patăk Koot dơơp Wơơt Lôôk ku dêh araak. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Paq kê kơyq xưng nhonq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu laa Koot Kơy Plêêk, yôôych Kơy Plêêk kưq măn đom adro nưq, ji adro nưq măn đom Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Haay heq xet ji heq tuôq xung xiaq đơu Kơy Plêêk e đom haay. Kơy Plêêk laa xung xiaq, ji kơyq kưq măn đom xung xiaq yôôych kưq măn đom Kơy Plêêk, ji Kơy Plêêk kưq măn đom adro nưq. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Gamưh đnư, xung xiaq heq jah dơơp ka xaleep kung dii haay xôq ka haay e varơuq kajưk xuum đom hngơy xưh xadrah, bơyh đaji Kadraq laa đaleq yôôych haay kung laa đanưq đom dêh araak neq. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Varơuq yôq varaal leh e đom xung xiaq, wih hlê, xung xiaq xaleep taweek ka'lăk varơuq yôq varaal vlôh pi gôk, vii varơuq yôq varaal tajinq dii hmơt dook. Măn dro yôq varaal 'miêh koq jah xaleep đom xung xiaq. <verse eid="1JN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Haay xiaq vii Kadraq heq xiaq haay adroyq. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Atoh kơyq đnooy đaneq: “Gô xiaq Kơy Plêêk,” đơu 'yarơ oh ay ni, yôôych nưq laa dro đnooy pa ôôh. Vii dro leh xiaq oh ay ni laa manih ni hloq ik yôôych dro nưq leh hnoq ik xiaq Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy ni leh hloq ik. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Dik, haay nhonq ganeen neq xing aduq Kadraq, nưq laa kơyq xiaq Kơy Plêêk yôôych kung pheq xiaq oh ay ni.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Atoh kơyq tuôq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh yôôych jah pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk, ji atoh kơyq xiaq Kơy heq pahleh vlôh ni yôôych kung xiaq adro heq jah pahleh vlôh bơyh Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Gamưh varơuq neq, haay xet đaneq haay xiaq koot xau Kơy Plêêk laa tuôôy haay xiaq Kơy Plêêk ji tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Vii neq laa varơuq xiaq kul Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa haay tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq. Kaluh ganeen ku Kadraq be aalq laa gengq parêq. <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />Vii atoh kơyq jah pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk yôôych jay iaq dêh araak. Ji neq laa varơuq jah jay, 'ngưq xuum tuôq ku haay, laa varơuq heq jay iaq dêh araak. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Đơu kơyq laa adro jay iaq dêh araak, atoh leh aalq manih tuôq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu laa Koot Kơy Plêêk? <verse eid="1JN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Nưq laa Kơy heq truh gamưh daak ji vahaap: Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu — leh vơ gamưh daak, bơh laa gamưh daak ji gamưh vahaap. Ji Kơy Phool Hiel laa Kơy dơơp xanưk, vii Kơy Phool Hiel laa varơuq dik. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Vii anưq, e pe varơuq dơơp xanưk: <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Kơy Phool Hiel kung dii daak ji vahaap, đơu dêq pe raay laa pato truh muuyq varơuq. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: </char><char style="fqa">Vii e pe kơq xanưk tol plêêk: Vaq, Apok Lôôk, ji Lôôk Yaak Plêêk. Pe kơq nưq ji muuyq; ji e pe kơq xanưk tol vari: Yaak Plêêk, daak, ji vahaap; pe kơq xanưk neq laa muuyq.</char> Lunưq, kaluh rahlăp đangq tuôq gamưh dik leh đok đanưq.</note> <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Atoh haay nhonq apok xanưk ku koot manih, yôôych apok xanưk ku Kơy Plêêk laa kôt galơh iaq. Vii neq laa apok xanưk ku Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa Kadraq heq dơơp xanưk truh Koot Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Kơyq tuôq aduq Koot Kơy Plêêk yôôych e apok xanưk nưq đom adro nưq. Kơyq leh tuôq Kơy Plêêk yôôych 'yo Kadraq laa dro đnooy pa ôôh, vii adro nưq leh tuôq aduq apok xanưk đơu Kơy Plêêk heq đnooy vlôh truh Koot Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Ji neq laa apok xanưk, nưq laa Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka haay varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, ji varơuq riirh nưq măn đom Koot Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Kơyq e Koot yôôych e varơuq riirh. Kơyq leh e Koot Kơy Plêêk yôôych leh e varơuq riirh.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Gô heq valơk taleq apok neq ka oh ay, laa ka khơl adro tuôq aduq yal Koot Kơy Plêêk, xôq oh ay xet đaneq haay e varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Măn neq laa varơuq tuôq kajưk đơu haay e ka aduq Kadraq, nưq laa atoh haay apôôy vôôch muuyq varơuq leq nưq tyauq iq trôôch Kadraq, yôôych Kadraq tameng haay. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Ji atoh haay xet đaneq Kadraq tameng haay long ju haay apôôy vôôch varơuq kajoq, yôôych haay xet đaneq haay nhonq jah kaluh varơuq apôôy đơu haay heq apôôy vôôch xing Kadraq. <verse eid="1JN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Atoh kơyq hloq adro oh ay ni lôp muuyq kadrôôp leh truh mưk kaxêêt, yôôych adro nưq hnoq apôôy vôôch, ji Kơy Plêêk hnoq kahniq varơuq riirh ka adro oh ay hơq, laa adro lôp kadrôôp leh truh mưk kaxêêt. E muuyq kadrôôp truh mưk kaxêêt; gô leh đnooy đaneq adro nưq duh apôôy truh kadrôôp nưq. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Tôôy varơuq leh hyioh jăk laa kadrôôp maroh, ji e kadrôôp leh truh mưk kaxêêt.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Haay xet đaneq atoh kơyq jah pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk yôôych leh raxôôt lôp kadrôôp, bơh Kơy 'miêh pahleh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk jư 'yo adro nưq, ji kamuuych leh ik đungq truh ni. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Haay xet đaneq haay thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk, măn dêq hloay dêh araak kul 'laarq kamuuych. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Bơh haay xet đaneq Koot Kơy Plêêk heq truh ji heq kahniq ka haay hlolh xet, xôq haay hnoq ik nhonq xet Kơy Dong Dik. Ji haay măn đom Kơy Dong Dik, 'ngưq đom Koot Kadraq, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Koot nưq laa Kơy Plêêk dong dik, ji laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="1JN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Khơl koot lơơy, dayh jư xăk klơlh vangưl.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>